%N A038311 Triangle whose (i,j)-th entry is binomial(i,j)*10^(i-j)*9^j.
%D A038311 B. N. Cyvin et al., Isomer enumeration of unbranched catacondensed polygonal systems with pentagons and heptagons, Match, No. 34 (Oct 1996), pp. 109-121.
%F A038311 T(n,k) = 9*T(n-1,k-1) + 10*T(n-1,k) with T(0,0)=1, T(n,k)=0 for k<0 or k>n. - _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Nov 17 2026
%e A038311 The triangle begins as:
%e A038311      1;
